\ relay_test.fam — a transaction relayed (docs/NODE.md, step 7), a program
\ for the OS with a disk and the network, after what sync_test.fam is.
\ scripts/pooltest.sh runs two tabminers on the host: one mining the
\ recursive dev network (UDP 37471, seen from the guest at 10.0.2.2), and
\ one with a wallet that does not mine (37472), whose only peer is this
\ node.  The node syncs from the miner as sync_test.fam does, takes the
\ wallet's node for a second peer, then follows the tip and relays: the
\ wallet's transaction fetched, pooled, announced to the miner, and gone
\ from the pool once a block mines it.

: tnet variable ;  : tdc variable ;  : tcr variable ;  : tseen variable ;

\ rdfile ( path -- addr n )  a whole file of at most 1.25 MiB, in memory.
: rdfile
0 lit open  dup 0< if "sync_test: no file" puts 0A lit putc then
140000 lit alloc
0 lit begin
	2 lit pick  2 lit pick 2 lit pick +  140000 lit 3 lit pick -  read
	dup 0 lit > while +
repeat drop
rot close drop ;

\ The recursive dev network (tabminer's ChainParams::DEV_RECURSIVE), as
\ headers.fam takes it: 2^10 items, 254 parents, 64 accesses; genesis's
\ target 2^228; the easiest 2^248 - 1; the drift 7,200 s; the median of
\ 11; the final height; 10 s blocks, a half-life of 300 s, from block 1.
: tparams
64 lit alloc dup tnet !
A lit over 0 lit w!  FE lit over 1 lit w!  40 lit over 2 lit w!
dup 3 lit 2 lit lshift + 8 lit wzero  10 lit over A lit w!
8 lit 0 lit do FFFFFFFF lit over i B lit + w! loop  FFFFFF lit over 12 lit w!
1C20 lit over 13 lit w!  B lit over 14 lit w!  3279DB0 lit over 15 lit w!
A lit over 16 lit w!  12C lit over 17 lit w!  1 lit swap 18 lit w! ;

"/lib/akjv.txt.gz" rdfile powinit
"/lib/chainver" rdfile drop cvinit
"/t-sync" TREE CREATE or 2 lit or open stinit  sninit  ninit  xinit tinit qinit
"/lib/devchain" rdfile drop 4 lit + tdc !
tparams  tnet @ tdc @ 60 lit + 1000 lit hinit
tdc @ dup 60 lit + prinit
\ our status: genesis, no work
20 lit alloc dup mygen !  0 lit he hid swap 8 lit wcopy
20 lit alloc dup mytip !  mygen @ swap 8 lit wcopy
20 lit alloc dup mywork ! 8 lit wzero  0 lit myh !
20 lit alloc tcr !
A000202 lit 925F lit E99 lit pinit
4 lit nsync dup "sync: " puts . "  height " puts myh @ u. "  S " puts nS @ u. 0A lit putc
0= if
	\ the wallet's node
	A000202 lit 9260 lit padd puse  pping  0 lit puse
	if "wallet peer: answered" else "wallet peer: no answer" then puts 0A lit putc
	\ up to ten minutes: following, relaying; until a transaction pooled
	\ has left the pool
	0 lit tseen !
	258 lit 0 lit do
		tseen @ 2 lit u< if
			1 lit nserve
			qnum @ if 1 lit tseen ! then
			tseen @ 1 lit = qnum @ 0= and if 2 lit tseen !  "left the pool: height " puts myh @ u. 0A lit putc then
		then
	loop
then
bye
